n-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Residori</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Conservative laparoscopy in the treatment of posttraumatic splenic laceration using microfiber hemostatic collagen</article-title><source>Surg Laparosc Endosc</source><year>1998</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>600</fpage><lpage>3</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT15"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ransom</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kavic</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic splenectomy following embolization for blunt trauma</article-title><source>J Soc Laparoendoscopic Surg</source><year>2008</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>202</fpage><lpage>5</lpage></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>